-- Only manufacturer pages are used: lifefitness.com for Hammer Strength and
-- myarsenalstrength.com for Arsenal Strength (arsenalstrength.com is an unrelated gym).
-- Rows still without an official value stay unverified with NULL values and a reason.
-- Rows are matched by (brand, lineup, model_name, setting); no new reference rows are
-- added and user machines or set totals are never written. Safe to re-run.
